ulator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, August to September landed at 32% of normal and September to October at 34%, on that same middle. Grid 25357 had its driest year in 1956 at 59%, while the other grids hit bottom in 1988.</p>"}
